<title>FRANCE: Lagardere takes full control of Matra Cap.</title>
<headline>Lagardere takes full control of Matra Cap.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lagardere Groupe said in a statement that its Matra unit had acquired a 50 percent stake in Matra Cap Systemes from Cap Gemini for an undisclosed amount.</p>
<p>Matra already had 50 percent in the joint venture company.</p>
<p>Matra Cap has annual sales of 800 million francs.</p>
</text>
